[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_REPORT]
Climate Observation

[en.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_REPORT_desc]
Across the southern sea, we can still see the glacier on the other side. The Windiogs hover there, but they always fly towards us from time to time, showing off their power in a domineering manner.\nIn the history of Kirin, there are records of civilization being destroyed by cold: a few are due to cold itself, most of the time because Kirin turn into Nirik to keep warm in the snow, burning everything to survive.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_REPORT]
气象观测

[zh.FOCUS_C18_101_CLIMATE_REPORT_desc]
隔着南方的大海，我们还依稀看得到对面的冰川。风之魔盘旋在远方，但总会时不时向我们飞来，耀武扬威式地展现着自己的力量。\n麒麟的历史上也有着文明灭亡于寒冷的记载：少部分是因为寒冷本身，多数时候是因为在雪地中麒麟们变成逆麟取暖，为了生存而焚烧一切。

